WEBVTT

NOTE Draft cue timing follows measured scene audio and word count. Review spoken word alignment before publication.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.699
The current self-hosted quick start describes a single Linux-server evaluation using Docker Compose.

00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:13.399
Plan separate web, API, and events hostnames. Infrastructure operation is a separate learning

00:00:13.399 --> 00:00:15.460
path from department administration.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:23.173
Review the supported installer, generate deployment-specific credentials, and inspect the resulting configuration. Start

00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:30.287
the stack, review worker migration progress, and verify all three endpoints. Create the

00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:33.570
first account and department after initialization.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:40.781
Department screens configure operational behavior. In this checkout, host configuration uses public static

00:00:40.781 --> 00:00:47.392
fields in configuration classes. The configuration processor reads JSON keys or environment variables

00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:54.003
and assigns those fields. Use the source and release documentation to identify the

00:00:54.003 --> 00:00:58.580
exact host setting; avoid applying a generic appsettings recipe.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:04.655
Before updating, back up the data and configuration and retain prior image references.

00:01:04.655 --> 00:01:10.131
A rollback can require restoring the database as well as the application. Treat

00:01:10.131 --> 00:01:15.606
a running evaluation as the start of operations preparation, with monitoring and a

00:01:15.606 --> 00:01:16.870
tested recovery procedure.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:23.846
Detailed infrastructure capture needs the chosen deployment layout: Linux Compose, Windows, Kubernetes or

00:01:23.846 --> 00:01:30.222
k3s, or an Incident Command Kit. Record the supported release and verify installation,

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:36.598
endpoint connectivity, backup, and recovery in that environment. Use the linked official guides

00:01:36.598 --> 00:01:38.560
for the matching layout.

